    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d581">

                <pb facs="0618" n="500" sameAs="frus:frus1929v03/pg500"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">452.11/223: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in Spain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Whitehouse</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-07-09T14:00:00-04:00">July 9, 1929—2
                    p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>37. Reference the Department’s 29, June 11, and telegram 17, July 7, from Tangier
                    to the Department.<anchor n="32" xml:id="d581-f1"/></p>
                <p>During the presence at Madrid of General Jordana from Morocco, you should
                    endeavor discreetly to hasten action by Primo de Rivera on the amended joint
                    report.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
